{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687960/extras/991bb46d9f21507a8437e9ed93309fc9.poster.avif?t=1770823901\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687960/extras/991bb46d9f21507a8437e9ed93309fc9.webm?t=1770823901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687960/extras/991bb46d9f21507a8437e9ed93309fc9.mp4?t=1770823901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your piloting skills in this endless runner set in a dystopian corporate future! Fly your space ship through the dangerous, hazard-filled orbit of Cetos while collecting salvage. Oh, and please try not to feed the fish - your supervisor won't appreciate the policy violation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIFFICULTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687960/extras/aef1eb7341ee8e81287a4eea0d135ffc.poster.avif?t=1770823901\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687960/extras/aef1eb7341ee8e81287a4eea0d135ffc.webm?t=1770823901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687960/extras/aef1eb7341ee8e81287a4eea0d135ffc.mp4?t=1770823901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game has difficult, single-life runs\u00a0that require fast and precise manipulation of your ship.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first run will likely end early with a collision with an asteroid. But don't worry - every run is a lesson that hones your flight skills. Developing an understanding of oncoming threats is critical to propelling yourself further each run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master <strong>a skill based flight mechanic</strong> that allows you to precisely orient your ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outpace a giant space fish</strong> determined to eat you for lunch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid asteroids, space mines, rogue missiles, and <strong>50+ other hazards</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate <strong>procedurally generated runs</strong> assembled from over <strong>100+ hand-crafted level segments</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress across <strong>4 unique regions</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive over 100+ lines of &quot;motivational&quot; dialog from your <strong>cat supervisor</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outperform other employees across <strong>online leaderboards</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable an optional\u00a0<strong>assist mode</strong>\u00a0to adjust the difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>12 alternative</strong> <strong>color palettes</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687960/extras/530f735ce955898f332af2999a9519a0.poster.avif?t=1770823901\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687960/extras/530f735ce955898f332af2999a9519a0.webm?t=1770823901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687960/extras/530f735ce955898f332af2999a9519a0.mp4?t=1770823901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></v